          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-20354 qmt: add per-slave quota usage cache for GETQUOTA",
        "message": "LU-20354 qmt: add per-slave quota usage cache for GETQUOTA\n\nLet QMT serve aggregated quota usage from an in-memory per-slave\ncache instead of always returning zero and forcing clients to fan\nout to every OST/MDT. Warm the cache from QSD DQACQ/REL piggybacked\nqb_usage, prefill granted at startup, and refresh stale/missing\nentries via OSP quotactl proxied through MDT. When the cache is not\nready or incomplete, keep legacy client fallback by omitting\nQIF_SPACE/QIF_INODES.\n\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly\nSigned-off-by: Keguang Xu <kxu@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: Ifb410442828ea8949b90cfa1e98495dfe3fb0503\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
